<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Shougang Concord suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Shougang Concord suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Shougang Concord International Enterprises Co Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The shares closed at HK$1.19 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
